From 6fd79d4804e2ec576c2a4248ccde30c941a84573 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 10:20:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: comprehensive UI redesign across Welcome, Shop,
 Classes, Journey, and Admin screens
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- WelcomeScreen: swap button styles (Sign In → red gradient, Guest → ghost outline), fix visual artifact, add carousel captions, replace second welcome photo
- ShopScreen: full redesign with Home design language, Create Voucher flow, My Vouchers (pending), My Orders (Confirmed/Cancelled tabs)
- ClassesScreen: full redesign with My Bookings section, class reservation voucher integration
- JourneyScreen: premium redesign with hero card, horizontal metric rail, redesigned timer, scrollable achievements; preserve all existing functionality
- AdminDashboardScreen: add Class Registrations entry to admin groups
- AdminManagementScreens: add AdminClassRegistrationsScreen for confirm/reject workflow
- voucherService: add createClassVoucher, getClassVouchers, getAllClassVouchers
- classService: integrate voucher creation/cancellation on class register/cancel
- entryContentService: add caption/captionSub fields, update slide content
- types/index.ts: extend VoucherType with 'Class Reservation'
- New route: src/app/admin/class-registrations.tsx

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DgrTKVT2AdPGzGMgBRVwhC
